                                                   *      SYNC RESET SUBROUTINE                                         *J
                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   **********************************************************************
                                                   * FUNCTION  THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBROUTINE IS TO TURN OFF THE RCA-110A
                                                   *           SYNC SIGNALS TO THE LVDC. THIS WILL BE ACCOMPLISHED BY
                                                   *           SETTING DISCRETE OUTPUT 1, WHICH CAUSES THE SYNC LOGIC TO
                                                   *           BE RESET. THE LVDC WILL THEN CYCLE WAITING FOR THE SYNC
                                                   *           INPUT TO RESET. WHEN SYNC IS RESET AND FOUND OFF, THE LVDC
                                                   *           WILL RETURN TO THE CALLING ROUTINE.
                                                   * ENTRY     SRS      ENTER TO RESET RCA-110 SYNC
                                                          ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
            030  0 03                              SRSRT  BSS     1
W    0 01 0 121  0 03    377  1  13                SRS    STO     777
     0 01 0 122  0 03    377  1  17                       CLA     777
     0 01 0 123  0 03    030  0  13                       STO     SRSRT
     0 01 0 124  0 03    017  1  17                       CLA     D.KB12
     0 01 0 125  0 03    016  0  12                       PIO     016          SET DISCRETE OUTPUT 1                     I
     0 01 0 126  0 03    057  0  12                SRS1   PIO     057
     0 01 0 127  0 03    032  1  06                       AND     D.KB23       IS SYNC OFF                               Q
     0 01 0 130  0 03    134  0  04                       TNZ     SRS2                                                   N
     0 01 0 131  0 03    017  1  17                       CLA     D.KB12                                                 Y
     0 01 0 132  0 03    012  0  12                       PIO     012          RESET DISCRETE OUTPUT 1                   I
     0 01 0 133  0 03    030  0  00                       HOP     SRSRT        RET TO CAL RT                             X
     0 01 0 134  0 03    134  0  00                SRS2   HOP*    PRUS         PTL REALTIME UPDATE SUBR.                 P
     0 01 0 135  0 03    126  0  10                       TRA     SRS1
