                                                   *      ISSUE STATUS CODE SUBROUTINE                                  *J
                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   **********************************************************************
                                                   * FUNCTION   THE FUNCTION OF THIS SUBROUTINE IS TO TELEMETER THE
                                                   *            STATUS CODE OF THE CURRENT ROUTINE, LOAD THE MODE
                                                   *            REGISTER, AND INTERRUPT THE RCA-110A BY ISSUING DO 2.
                                                   *            SYNC IS THEN RECEIVED FROM THE RCA-110A AND RESET BY
                                                   *            THE SYNC RESET SUBROUTINE. A DELAY OF 6 MS. IS UTILIZED
                                                   *            TO INSURE THE SYNC SIGNAL HAS BEEN RESET AND CONTROL IS
                                                   *            RETURNED TO THE CALLING ROUTINE.
                                                   * ENTRY      ISS      ENTER TO ISSUE STATUS CODE
                                                          ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
            036  0 03                              ISSRT  BSS     1
W    0 01 0 136  0 03    377  1  13                ISS    STO     777
     0 01 0 137  0 03    271  1  13                       STO     V.STAT
     0 01 0 140  0 03    271  1  12                       PIO     671          TELEMETER PRESENT STATUS CODE             B
     0 01 0 141  0 03    006  0  12                       PIO     006          PLACE THE PRESENT STATUS CODE IN THE MODE B
                                                   *                           REGISTER                                  B
     0 01 0 142  0 03    377  1  17                       CLA     777
     0 01 0 143  0 03    036  0  13                       STO     ISSRT
     0 01 0 144  0 03    077  0  00                       HOP*    OIGS         GENERATE OUTPUT INTERRUPT                 P
     0 01 0 145  0 03    143  0  17    045000000          CLA     =O045        DELAY 6 MS                                B
     0 01 0 146  0 03    013  1  02                       SUB     D.KB8
     0 01 0 147  0 03    146  0  04                       TNZ     *-1
     0 01 0 150  0 03    036  0  00                       HOP     ISSRT        RET TO CAL RT                             X
