                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   *                                                                    *
                                                   **********************************************************************
                                                   * FUNCTION  THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBRROUTINE IS TO PROVIDE AN INTERRUPT
                                                   *           AFTER CERTAIN COMPUTER TELEMETRY OPERATIONS.
                                                   *           AFTER ISSUING THE INTERRUPT (DO2) TO THE LAUNCH COMPUTER,
                                                   *           THIS SUBROUTINE WAITS 1 MS. FOR THE SYNC SIGNAL FROM THE
                                                   *           LAUNCH COMPUTER. WHEN SYNC IS DETECTED, THE SUBROUTINE
                                                   *           ISSUES SYNC RESET AND RETURNS TO CALLING ROUTINE.
                                                   * ENTRY     OIGS     ENTER TO GENERATE OUTPUT-INTERRUPT
                                                          ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
            037  0 03                              OIGSRT BSS     1
W    0 01 0 151  0 03    377  1  13                OIGS   STO     777
     0 01 0 152  0 03    377  1  17                       CLA     777
     0 01 0 153  0 03    037  0  13                       STO     OIGSRT
     0 01 0 154  0 03    134  0  00                       HOP*    PRUS         PTL REALTIME UPDATE SUBR.                 P
     0 01 0 155  0 03    016  1  17                       CLA     D.KB11
     0 01 0 156  0 03    016  0  12                       PIO     016          SET DISCRETE OUTPUT NUMBER 2              I
     0 01 0 157  0 03    144  0  17    500000000          CLA     =O5
     0 01 0 160  0 03    005  1  02    100000000   OIGS1  SUB     =O1          HAS 1 MS ELAPSED                          Q
     0 01 0 161  0 03    160  0  04                       TNZ     OIGS1                                                  N
     0 01 0 162  0 03    016  1  17                       CLA     D.KB11                                                 Y
     0 01 0 163  0 03    012  0  12                       PIO     012          RESET DISCRETE OUTPUT NUMBER 2            I
     0 01 0 164  0 03    057  0  12                OIGS2  PIO     057
     0 01 0 165  0 03    032  1  06                       AND     D.KB23       IS SYNC DISCRETE ON                       Q
     0 01 0 166  0 03    170  0  04                       TNZ     *+2                                                    Y
     0 01 0 167  0 03    164  0  10                       TRA     OIGS2                                                  N
     0 01 0 170  0 03    100  0  00                       HOP*    SRS          SYNC RESET SUBROUTINE                     P
     0 01 0 171  0 03    037  0  00                       HOP     OIGSRT       RET TO CAL RT                             X
